    <string name="share_reminder_morning_1">start your day with clarity before you absorb every voice around you.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_morning_2">set your intention early: verify before believing, and reflect before reacting.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_morning_3">let this verse anchor your mind before the rush begins.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_afternoon_1">pause in the middle of your day and realign your heart with what is true.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_afternoon_2">protect your peace by filtering what you hear and what you repeat.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_afternoon_3">let this verse interrupt assumptions and restore clarity.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_evening_1">before the day closes, return your heart to truth and humility.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_evening_2">slow down tonight and release conclusions you built without certainty.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_evening_3">let this verse cleanse today\'s noise before it enters your heart.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_night_1">before you rest, leave rumours behind and hold on to what is clear.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_night_2">close your night with reflection, not assumptions.</string>
    <string name="share_reminder_night_3">let this verse be your final filter before sleep.</string>

